        "username": "AnachronismAxe",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anachronismaxe/{size}/2163_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-08T21:07:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>After omnitron is hit wih damage, you run through all the effects of the subroutine. If the attack was melee, the first card would make him immune. Then  the second one would resolve and also make him immune to melee. It just means you’d have to destroy two cards before the effect goes away.</p>",
